out.push(A('**Rows 2 and 4 on both cards are thanks with no content and the room must name the act in each, which is none.** ⚠ **Rows 5 are the ones to spend the time on**: one declares a withheld sentence and one reports a dated failure, **and both are more respectful than any of the four thanks.** **Make the room say why** — **because both treat the keeper as somebody who can be told a true thing, and thanks treats them as somebody who needs to be managed.**'));
