out.push(A('⚠ **Part 1 is marked on the ground given for the choice and this is where the class loses marks.** **The task says _explain which two you have chosen and why_, and about half of all scripts name the two and never say why.** **The sample gives the ground in the first sentence** — **each can be judged by what happened** — **and it is the same ground for both, which is allowed and stronger than two separate reasons.** **The third point must then be dropped entirely: a script that returns to the keeper in its last paragraph has discussed three.** ⚠ **And note what the last paragraph does.** **It compares the two chosen points rather than summarising them** — **a rule against a discipline** — **which is the one move that lifts a Part 1 essay out of band 3.**'));
